    "The Christmas albums connect with music I have enjoyed before, but seasonal listening is not what I want right now, even when the vocal style appeals to me.",
    "Same Trailer Different Park relates to my country listening, and 25 offers another vocal option, but neither matches my current interest in theatrical singing or relaxing classical music closely enough."
