    "My past Christmas listening seems to have been treated as an ongoing desire for holiday music.",
    "My interest in several kinds of singers seems to have been stretched into a broad appetite for vocal albums, when the songs and mood matter more to my choice today."
  ],
  "missing_or_underweighted_signals": [
    "The connection between Stages and A Musical Affair matters strongly to me: recognizable stage songs and expressive theatrical performances make an album especially inviting.",
